EMBEDDED TYPEFACE

`@ccgrapher/render-svg` embeds the Caveat typeface into the SVG files it
produces, so that a rendered diagram displays identically on a machine that does
not have the font installed. Every such SVG therefore redistributes the font and
carries its attribution inline.

    Caveat
    Copyright 2014 The Caveat Project Authors
    https://github.com/googlefonts/caveat
    SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1 — https://scripts.sil.org/OFL

The font is unmodified. Pass `--no-embed-font` to `ccg render` to reference the
typeface by family name instead of embedding it.

Full licence texts and the wider dependency inventory are in
THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md.
